flowchart TD
    START([Start]) -->|question| ROUTER[Router]
    ROUTER -->|route| PLANNER[Planner]
    PLANNER -->|task| RESEARCHER[Researcher]
    RESEARCHER -->|candidates| SOURCE[Source Validator]
    SOURCE -->|evidence| JUDGE[Sufficiency Judge]
    JUDGE -->|continue| RESEARCHER
    JUDGE -->|sufficient| SYNTH[Synthesizer]
    JUDGE -->|stop| END([End])
    SYNTH -->|answer| END
